<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Invoice Overdue - Action Required</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #0F172A; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f5f7; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626 0%, #b91c1c 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; }
        .header .icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .content { padding: 40px 30px; }
        .alert-box { background: #fef2f2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #fecaca; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626; }
        .alert-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #dc2626; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .alert-text { color: #7f1d1d; font-size: 14px; }
        .invoice-box { background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; }
        .invoice-amount { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: #dc2626; }
        .invoice-label { font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 8px; }
        .details-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
        .details-table td { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
        .details-table td:first-child { color: #6b7280; }
        .details-table td:last-child { text-align: right; font-weight: 500; }
        .overdue { color: #dc2626; font-weight: 600; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background: #dc2626; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 16px; }
        .btn:hover { background: #b91c1c; }
        .consequences { background: #fffbeb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #fcd34d; }
        .consequences h4 { color: #92400e; margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 14px; }
        .consequences ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #78350f; font-size: 13px; }
        .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; }
        .footer a { color: #85182F; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="icon">⚠️</div>
            <h1>Invoice Overdue</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
            
            <div class="alert-box">
                <div class="alert-title">Immediate Action Required</div>
                <div class="alert-text">
                    Your invoice #{{invoiceNumber}} is now <strong>{{daysOverdue}} days overdue</strong>. 
                    Please make payment as soon as possible to avoid service interruption.
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="invoice-box">
                <div class="invoice-amount">{{currency}} {{amount}}</div>
                <div class="invoice-label">Amount Due</div>
            </div>
            
            <table class="details-table">
                <tr>
                    <td>Invoice Number</td>
                    <td>#{{invoiceNumber}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Original Due Date</td>
                    <td class="overdue">{{dueDate}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Days Overdue</td>
                    <td class="overdue">{{daysOverdue}} days</td>
                </tr>
                {{#if planName}}
                <tr>
                    <td>Plan</td>
                    <td>{{planName}}</td>
                </tr>
                {{/if}}
            </table>
            
            <p style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{paymentUrl}}" class="btn">Pay Now</a>
            </p>
            
            <div class="consequences">
                <h4>What happens if payment is not received?</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Your account may be restricted or suspended</li>
                    <li>You may lose access to premium features</li>
                    <li>Late fees may be applied</li>
                    <li>Your subscription may be canceled</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <p>If you're experiencing financial difficulties or have questions about your bill, please <a href="{{supportUrl}}" style="color: #85182F;">contact our support team</a>. We're here to help find a solution.</p>
            
            <p>Best regards,<br>The {{companyName}} Billing Team</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>{{companyName}} • {{companyAddress}}</p>
            <p>
                <a href="{{billingPortalUrl}}">Billing Portal</a> • 
                <a href="{{supportUrl}}">Support</a> • 
                <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">Email Preferences</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

